// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// HERO BALANCE: prices and stats for every special hero, in one place.
//
// Edit the numbers, then rebuild. The API (what players are charged, their
// stats, dungeon power) and the app (Shop, Hero tab) both read this file, so
// publish the API and ship a new app build together after changing it.
//
//   id       sprite id; don't change it (players' purchases are saved by id)
//   name     shown in the Shop and CUSTOMIZE
//   rarity   Common, Rare, Epic or Legendary: the outline colour
//   price    gold
//   pieces   the outfit the hero comes dressed in, one per slot at most:
//              slot   Head, Top, Bottom, Shoes or Accessory
//              name   shown on the Hero tab
//              stat   STR, END or FLX
//              bonus  stat points added while this hero is selected
//                     (10 points = 1 stat level)
//
// For reference, gear gives +2 (Common), +5 (Rare), +10 (Epic) or +20
// (Legendary) per item, and gear prices live in
// MDRNJfitness/Helpers/Sprites/SpriteReferences/GearReferences/gear.json.
// The Classic Hero is free and wears gear, so it isn't listed here.
// Heroes appear in CUSTOMIZE in this order; the Shop sorts them by price.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
[
  {
    "id": "starting_girl",
    "name": "Athletic Girl",
    "rarity": "Rare",
    "price": 1200,
    "pieces": [
      { "slot": "Head",   "name": "Hair Tie",       "stat": "FLX", "bonus": 5 },
      { "slot": "Top",    "name": "Sports Top",     "stat": "END", "bonus": 5 },
      { "slot": "Bottom", "name": "Running Shorts", "stat": "END", "bonus": 5 },
